        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 780, Single Cylinder Kwikset Grade 2 Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA single cylinder deadbolt, this front door lock is operated by a key on the exterior and a thumbturn on the interior. Made by Kwikset, the 780 single cylinder deadbolt is rated as an ANSI/BHMA A156.2 grade 2 security lock. Adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\". It is made of solid brass and is backed by a lifetime mechanical warranty. It is designed with a patented side locking bar technology offers improved security by protecting against lock bumping.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> Deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key on the outside and by a thumbturn on the inside.</p>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Matching  <a href=\"/products/grade-2-double-cylinder-deadbolt-lock-kwikset-785\"><b>Kwikset Double Cylinder Deadbolt.</b></a> Please see our guide on <a href=\"/pages/how-to-choose-the-best-deadbolt\">how to choose the best deadbolt</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Kwikset Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul> \r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 2 Security</li>\r\n<li>Patented side locking bar technology offers improved security by protecting against lock bumping.</li>\r\n<li>6 pin cylinder locks.</li>\r\n<li>Free spinning cylinder.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-pry shield.</li>\r\n<li>1\" deadbolt throw with stainless steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Grade 2 Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Diameter: 2-5/8</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Length: 1-25/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for both 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" or 1-1/2\" Crossbore Hole</li>\r\n<li>Standard 1\" x 2-1/4\" Square Corner Strike Plate</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
